    <item>
      <title>软件的“中年危机”：当溢价被智能体无情稀释</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/article-20260204194007582-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 04 Feb 2026 19:40:07 +0800</pubDate>
